<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In large projects, failed pull requests can slow down the merge process and waste time. The paper solves this by reordering PRs so that the ones most likely to pass are tested first, speeding up merges and improving efficiency.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
227 0 obj
<<
