238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Addressing the limitations of existing research, we observed that pull request \(PR\) prioritization and reviewer assignment are often treated as separate problems, despite both being major contributors to PR latency. Most current approaches rely on traditional machine learning techniques, heuristics which, when applied independently, result in inefficiencies and fail to provide an integrated framework for optimizing both tasks simultaneously.)
/E (Addressing the limitations of existing research, we observed that pull request \(PR\) prioritization and reviewer assignment are often treated as separate problems, despite both being major contributors to PR latency. Most current approaches rely on traditional machine learning techniques, heuristics which, when applied independently, result in inefficiencies and fail to provide an integrated framework for optimizing both tasks simultaneously.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
